 .../repomd-repo1-gpg/repodata/repomd.xml      | 11 +++
 .../repomd-repo1-gpg/repodata/repomd.xml.asc  | 16 ++++
 test/libdnf5/repo/test_repo.cpp               | 79 ++++++++++++++-
